{"id":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","revision":0,"last_node_id":157,"last_link_id":402,"nodes":[{"id":116,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-3623.9999999999977,4208.571414184571],"size":[620,980],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Note: DSH_av2av 使用说明","properties":{},"widgets_values":["## DSH_av2av — 原视频 + 人物三视图 → 尝试只替换人物\n\n### 输入\n1. 节点 150 `Load Video`：原始视频。\n2. 节点 153 `Load Image`：替换角色三视图（正面 / 侧面 / 背面建议拼成一张）。请确认图片文件存在于 ComfyUI 的输入目录。\n\n### 本版调整\n- 重写提示词：去掉固定的 7.5s / 13s 时间点，强调动作、镜头、遮挡和环境连续性。\n- `ref_image_size` 设为 `max`，优先强化人物参考图约束；速度可能变慢。\n- 固定随机种子，方便和旧版做同素材对照。需要尝试其他结果时再手动更换种子。\n- 默认关闭 Lightning LoRA，走完整采样路径（当前步数为 44）；优先评估质量，速度会较慢。\n- 保留原音轨直连输出节点，不让模型生成新的音频。\n\n### 重要限制\n这是 H3 参考视频生成流程，不是带人物分割遮罩的像素级合成流程。即使提示词要求背景不变，模型仍可能重绘背景、道具、人物边缘或遮挡关系；`ref_image_size=max` 也不能保证背景逐像素不变。\n\n如果“背景绝对不变”是硬性要求，后续需要增加人物分割/跟踪遮罩，并将生成的人物区域合成回原始帧；遮罩之外直接使用原始视频帧，才能最大程度锁定背景。\n\n### 音频\n节点 152 的原音轨直接连接到节点 130 `Create Video`，目的是保留原声而不让模型重新生成声音。由于输出视频仍需封装/编码，这不等于保证音频逐字节一致。若要求音频数据完全不变，建议最后用 FFmpeg 将原视频音轨重新封装到生成视频中。\n\n### 分辨率、时长和内存\n- 当前生成分辨率由节点 115 的 `16:9` 和 `1 MP` 决定；如果源视频不是 16:9，请按原视频比例调整，避免构图被改变。\n- 节点 151 的 `duration=0` 表示使用整段视频；先用短片段测试，再处理完整片段。\n- 视频帧会被节点 157 对齐到工作流所需的帧率语义。输出时长和音画同步仍应在成片中检查。\n- `Get Video Components` 会解码视频帧并占用系统内存。不要只按文件 MB 大小判断负载；优先使用低分辨率、短时长测试素材。\n\n### 建议检查\n逐帧检查人物轮廓、头发、手指、与道具的遮挡、背景文字/纹理、镜头运动、首尾帧，以及音画同步。"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## DSH_av2av — 原视频 + 人物三视图 → 尝试只替换人物\n\n### 输入\n1. 节点 150 `Load Video`：原始视频。\n2. 节点 153 `Load Image`：替换角色三视图（正面 / 侧面 / 背面建议拼成一张）。请确认图片文件存在于 ComfyUI 的输入目录。\n\n### 本版调整\n- 重写提示词：去掉固定的 7.5s / 13s 时间点，强调动作、镜头、遮挡和环境连续性。\n- `ref_image_size` 设为 `max`，优先强化人物参考图约束；速度可能变慢。\n- 固定随机种子，方便和旧版做同素材对照。需要尝试其他结果时再手动更换种子。\n- 默认关闭 Lightning LoRA，走完整采样路径（当前步数为 44）；优先评估质量，速度会较慢。\n- 保留原音轨直连输出节点，不让模型生成新的音频。\n\n### 重要限制\n这是 H3 参考视频生成流程，不是带人物分割遮罩的像素级合成流程。即使提示词要求背景不变，模型仍可能重绘背景、道具、人物边缘或遮挡关系；`ref_image_size=max` 也不能保证背景逐像素不变。\n\n如果“背景绝对不变”是硬性要求，后续需要增加人物分割/跟踪遮罩，并将生成的人物区域合成回原始帧；遮罩之外直接使用原始视频帧，才能最大程度锁定背景。\n\n### 音频\n节点 152 的原音轨直接连接到节点 130 `Create Video`，目的是保留原声而不让模型重新生成声音。由于输出视频仍需封装/编码，这不等于保证音频逐字节一致。若要求音频数据完全不变，建议最后用 FFmpeg 将原视频音轨重新封装到生成视频中。\n\n### 分辨率、时长和内存\n- 当前生成分辨率由节点 115 的 `16:9` 和 `1 MP` 决定；如果源视频不是 16:9，请按原视频比例调整，避免构图被改变。\n- 节点 151 的 `duration=0` 表示使用整段视频；先用短片段测试，再处理完整片段。\n- 视频帧会被节点 157 对齐到工作流所需的帧率语义。输出时长和音画同步仍应在成片中检查。\n- `Get Video Components` 会解码视频帧并占用系统内存。不要只按文件 MB 大小判断负载；优先使用低分辨率、短时长测试素材。\n\n### 建议检查\n逐帧检查人物轮廓、头发、手指、与道具的遮挡、背景文字/纹理、镜头运动、首尾帧，以及音画同步。"},"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":138,"type":"PrimitiveStringMultiline","pos":[-1673.8987223120805,4232.898776214687],"size":[762.5102676374652,778.6439769564467],"flags":{},"order":1,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"值","name":"value","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"value"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"字符串","name":"STRING","type":"STRING","links":[279]}],"title":"Input Text (Prompt)","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"PrimitiveStringMultiline"},"widgets_values":["subject_definitions:\n<Video 1> is the original source footage and the master reference for motion, timing, camera movement, framing, lighting, occlusion, and environment.\n<Picture 1> is the replacement character reference sheet. Preserve this character's recognizable face, hairstyle, skin tone, body proportions, and outfit as closely as possible.\n\ntask:\nPerform a direct character replacement in the original footage. Replace only the visible original performer with the character from <Picture 1>. This is an edit of the existing shot, not a new scene generation.\n\npreserve_from_video_1:\n- Keep the original environment and background: location, walls, floor, furniture, objects, signs, textures, colours, shadows, and light direction.\n- Keep the original camera position, lens perspective, framing, camera movement, exposure, and shot timing.\n- Follow the source performer's pose, movement, gestures, gait, head direction, and timing as closely as possible.\n- Preserve the original foreground/background occlusion order. Hands, props, hair, and body parts must interact with the scene naturally.\n- Keep every non-performer object in its original position. Do not add, remove, move, redesign, or restyle scene elements.\n\nreplace_character:\n- The original performer should not remain visible where the replacement is meant to cover them.\n- Match the replacement character's scale, position, perspective, and lighting to the source performer.\n- Keep the same identity and outfit throughout the clip; avoid face drift, costume changes, duplicated limbs, extra fingers, ghosting, halos, or flickering edges.\n- Maintain natural contact shadows and believable edges against the existing scene.\n\ncontinuity:\nThe first frame begins at the source video's corresponding moment, and the final frame ends at the source video's corresponding final moment. Preserve the action order and continuous motion; do not invent cuts, pauses, camera moves, objects, or events.\n\npriority:\n1. Replace the performer with the referenced character.\n2. Preserve the original background, objects, lighting, camera, and timing.\n3. Preserve motion and character identity consistently across frames.\n\nThe intended result is the original shot with only the performer replaced. Do not intentionally regenerate the background or create a different scene.\n\nSound: use the source video's original soundtrack if available; do not generate new music or sound effects."],"widgets_values_named":{"value":"subject_definitions:\n<Video 1> is the original source footage and the master reference for motion, timing, camera movement, framing, lighting, occlusion, and environment.\n<Picture 1> is the replacement character reference sheet. Preserve this character's recognizable face, hairstyle, skin tone, body proportions, and outfit as closely as possible.\n\ntask:\nPerform a direct character replacement in the original footage. Replace only the visible original performer with the character from <Picture 1>. This is an edit of the existing shot, not a new scene generation.\n\npreserve_from_video_1:\n- Keep the original environment and background: location, walls, floor, furniture, objects, signs, textures, colours, shadows, and light direction.\n- Keep the original camera position, lens perspective, framing, camera movement, exposure, and shot timing.\n- Follow the source performer's pose, movement, gestures, gait, head direction, and timing as closely as possible.\n- Preserve the original foreground/background occlusion order. Hands, props, hair, and body parts must interact with the scene naturally.\n- Keep every non-performer object in its original position. Do not add, remove, move, redesign, or restyle scene elements.\n\nreplace_character:\n- The original performer should not remain visible where the replacement is meant to cover them.\n- Match the replacement character's scale, position, perspective, and lighting to the source performer.\n- Keep the same identity and outfit throughout the clip; avoid face drift, costume changes, duplicated limbs, extra fingers, ghosting, halos, or flickering edges.\n- Maintain natural contact shadows and believable edges against the existing scene.\n\ncontinuity:\nThe first frame begins at the source video's corresponding moment, and the final frame ends at the source video's corresponding final moment. Preserve the action order and continuous motion; do not invent cuts, pauses, camera moves, objects, or events.\n\npriority:\n1. Replace the performer with the referenced character.\n2. Preserve the original background, objects, lighting, camera, and timing.\n3. Preserve motion and character identity consistently across frames.\n\nThe intended result is the original shot with only the performer replaced. Do not intentionally regenerate the background or create a different scene.\n\nSound: use the source video's original soundtrack if available; do not generate new music or sound effects."}},{"id":150,"type":"LoadVideo","pos":[-2725.4110416169983,5547.111004888991],"size":[340,440],"flags":{},"order":2,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"文件","name":"file","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"file"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"选择要上传的文件","name":"upload","type":"IMAGEUPLOAD","widget":{"name":"upload"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"视频","name":"VIDEO","type":"VIDEO","links":[285]}],"title":"Load Video (原视频 -> <Video 1>)","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"LoadVideo"},"widgets_values":["","image"],"widgets_values_named":{"file":"","upload":"image"},"color":"#322","bgcolor":"#533"},{"id":151,"type":"Video Slice","pos":[-2333.474949981659,5551.949343017237],"size":[290,140],"flags":{},"order":14,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"视频","name":"video","type":"VIDEO","link":285},{"localized_name":"起始时间","name":"start_time","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"start_time"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"时长","name":"duration","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"duration"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"严格时长","name":"strict_duration","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"strict_duration"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"视频","name":"VIDEO","type":"VIDEO","links":[286]}],"title":"Trim Video (与输出等长)","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"Video Slice"},"widgets_values":[0,0,false],"widgets_values_named":{"start_time":0,"duration":0,"strict_duration":false}},{"id":152,"type":"GetVideoComponents","pos":[-2332.482631757432,5740.644908999103],"size":[316.605078125,140],"flags":{},"order":17,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"视频","name":"video","type":"VIDEO","link":286}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"图像","name":"images","type":"IMAGE","links":[306]},{"localized_name":"音频","name":"audio","type":"AUDIO","links":[401,402]},{"localized_name":"帧率","name":"fps","type":"FLOAT","links":[307]},{"localized_name":"bit_depth","name":"bit_depth","type":"COMBO","links":null},{"localized_name":"color_space","name":"color_space","type":"COMBO","links":null}],"title":"Get Video Components (取帧 -> ref_video)","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"GetVideoComponents"}},{"id":153,"t